# Motion

- Duration 160–220ms, ease-out `cubic-bezier(.2,.7,.2,1)`, no bounce or overshoot. Tokens live in `packages/ui/src/motion.ts` and CSS variables.
- CSS transitions by default; `motion-v` only for list reordering and route-line animation.
- Meaningful motion only: pencil→ink fill (200ms), route line advancing, Needs-you stack settling, live-window control handoff.
- `prefers-reduced-motion`: all motion becomes an instant state change.
- No loading spinners on content that can show a skeleton; no decorative parallax, confetti, or looping animation.
